## partylog
The stand-ins' party log: at eleven, all was quiet in the Study.
## weapon
Shoved out of sight: the Gravity Gauntlet, still warm. Dr. Briefs keeps it in the Robot Workshop, so whoever used it was in there earlier in the night.
## evidence
You find fresh scorch marks, the wallpaper still smoking. (evidence #1)
You find a trail of light, quick footprints through spilled punch. (evidence #2)
You find a tuft of something that is not dark hair. (evidence #3)
You find a fork with a smear of birthday frosting. (evidence #4)
You find an untouched slice of cake, the fork never lifted. (evidence #5)
You find deep footprints pressed into the carpet pile. (evidence #6)
## plate
Mrs. Briefs' stand-in checks her list: Piccolo refused the cake.
