## first-statements
Piccolo tells you, 'Make it quick. Here.'
At nine: "In the Robot Workshop, with Emperor Pilaf and Krillin. Hmph."
At ten: "In the Robot Workshop, with Dende. I do not need to explain myself."
At eleven: "In the Study, with Mr. Satan and Tien. Watching. I am always watching."
At midnight: "In the Dining Room, with Krillin and Dende. Wasting my time at a party."
Mr. Satan tells you, 'The champ was signing autographs all night! Here is the whole schedule.'
At nine: "In the Study, with Master Roshi and Videl. Signing autographs, of course!"
At ten: "In the Family Lounge, with Yajirobe and Videl. Everyone saw me. Everyone always does!"
At eleven: "In the Study, with Tien and Piccolo. Hahaha! Ask my fans!"
At midnight: "In the Robot Workshop, with Puar and Mr. Popo. Training. Champions never rest!"
