## accuse
Accuse in one line, anywhere in the house:
  accuse <suspect> with <weapon> at <time>
Suspects: roshi launch yajirobe pilaf
          satan tien piccolo videl
Weapons:  gauntlet jacket lights
          dream hornets taser
Times:    nine ten eleven midnight (or 9 to 12)
Example:  accuse launch with dream at ten
Short:    accuse launch dream 10
Then accuse yes makes the arrest.
Findings: 15 of 4. Three wrong and the case goes cold.
